# TalentLens AI — Resume Screening & Job-Role Prediction

An advanced AI-powered recruitment platform that analyses PDF/DOCX resumes, predicts suitable job roles and calculates an explainable job-match score.

## About the Project

TalentLens AI helps candidates understand how well their resumes match a particular job. Recruiters can create jobs, review ranked candidates and manage the recruitment process. Administrators can monitor users, jobs, applications and platform analytics.

AI results are used only to assist recruiters. The final shortlisting, rejection or hiring decision is always made by a human recruiter.

## Main Features

### Candidate Features

* Secure registration and login
* Browse available jobs
* Upload PDF or DOCX resumes
* AI-based resume analysis
* Job-description matching
* Job-role prediction
* Overall match percentage
* Skill, semantic and experience scores
* Matched and missing skills
* Resume improvement recommendations
* Application status tracking

### Recruiter Features

* Recruiter dashboard
* Create and manage jobs
* Add required skills and experience
* View ranked candidates
* Review AI analysis results
* Shortlist candidates
* Reject applications
* Mark candidates as hired

### Administrator Features

* Professional admin dashboard
* Manage candidates and recruiters
* Change user roles
* Enable or disable accounts
* View total users, jobs and applications
* Application pipeline analytics
* Predicted job-role analytics
* Monthly activity reports
* System audit history

