## AI Scoring Method

The overall resume score is calculated using:

```text
Overall Score =
Skills Match × 55%
+ Semantic Similarity × 30%
+ Experience Match × 15%
```

The system provides:

* Skills match score
* Semantic similarity score
* Experience score
* Predicted job role
* Role confidence
* Matched skills
* Missing skills
* Improvement recommendations

