## Running the Project with Docker

### Requirements

* Docker Desktop
* Docker Compose

Copy `.env.example` and rename the copied file to `.env`.

Run:

```bash
docker compose up --build -d
```

Add demo users and jobs:

```bash
docker compose exec api node src/seed.js
```

Open the application:

```text
http://localhost:5173
```

## Running Without Docker

### Start the AI Service

```bash
cd ai-service
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

### Start the Backend

```bash
cd server
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Start the Frontend

```bash
cd client
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open:

```text
http://localhost:5173
```

