## Security Features

* Password hashing using bcrypt
* JWT authentication
* Role-based access control
* API rate limiting
* Helmet security headers
* CORS configuration
* MongoDB query sanitisation
* File type and size validation
* Random resume filenames
* Protected AI service
* Audit logging
* Environment-variable protection

## Important Security Notice

Never upload the following to GitHub:

```text
.env
node_modules
.venv
dist
uploaded resumes
database passwords
JWT secrets
API keys
```

